<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="ecs_async" data-frame="18. ECS Services, Cache and Async Responses" transform="translate(8000,7680)"><rect data-type="frame" x="0" y="0" width="3200" height="2240" fill="#ffffff"/><textArea x="64" y="64" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="67" font-weight="bold" fill="#231266">18. ECS Services, Cache and Async Responses</textArea><textArea x="64" y="184" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#231266">Independent UI, API and workers. Accepted means durably saved; payment and fulfillment completion have separate states.</textArea><rect id="ecs_web" x="64" y="416" width="608" height="432" fill="#9CE6FF" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="Web ECS service&lt;br&gt;Next.js UI / BFF&lt;br&gt;Independent scaling&lt;br&gt;No commerce DB access" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><rect id="ecs_api" x="832" y="416" width="608" height="432" fill="#9CE6FF" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="API ECS service&lt;br&gt;Kotlin / Spring Boot&lt;br&gt;Auth / quote / orders&lt;br&gt;Returns owned status URL" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><rect id="ecs_db" x="1600" y="416" width="608" height="432" fill="#FFE86D" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="RDS PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;Short ACID commit&lt;br&gt;Order / stock / outbox&lt;br&gt;No provider call in locks" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><rect id="ecs_workers" x="2368" y="416" width="608" height="432" fill="#B8ACFB" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="Worker ECS services&lt;br&gt;Payment / fulfillment&lt;br&gt;Refund / notification&lt;br&gt;Catalog-media / outbox" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><line id="ecs_edge0" x1="672" y1="632" x2="832" y2="632" data-start="ecs_web" data-end="ecs_api" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="ecs_edge1" x1="1440" y1="632" x2="1600" y2="632" data-start="ecs_api" data-end="ecs_db" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="ecs_edge2" x1="2208" y1="632" x2="2368" y2="632" data-start="ecs_db" data-end="ecs_workers" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><textArea x="64" y="928" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" font-weight="bold" fill="#231266">Customer flow: saved order -&gt; preparing payment -&gt; checkout ready -&gt; verification pending -&gt; confirmed -&gt; delivery updates.</textArea><rect id="ecs_card0" x="64" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#FFE86D" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><textArea x="96" y="1184" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" font-weight="bold" fill="#231266">Cache boundaries</textArea><textArea x="96" y="1296" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#231266">CloudFront: UI assets and public media. Valkey: versioned public catalog. Private pages, carts, quotes, ownership, payment/refund truth and stock decisions bypass shared caches.</textArea><rect id="ecs_card1" x="1104" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#B8ACFB" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><textArea x="1136" y="1184" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" font-weight="bold" fill="#231266">Prompt async response</textArea><textArea x="1136" y="1296" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#231266">Return 202 only after durable order / reservation / attempt / outbox commit. A worker prepares payment; UI polls owned status. Verified payment triggers fulfillment without waiting for delivery jobs.</textArea><rect id="ecs_card2" x="2144" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#9CE6FF" stroke="#757575" stroke-width="2" data-content="" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" data-text-color="#231266"/><textArea x="2176" y="1184" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" font-weight="bold" fill="#231266">Independent operations</textArea><textArea x="2176" y="1296" width="928" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#231266">Per-service roles, secrets, deployments and scaling. Bound total DB connections and provider concurrency. Isolate queue failures; reconcile unknown outcomes. Migration is a controlled one-off task.</textArea><textArea x="64" y="1952" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#231266">Security/test gates: prepared SQL, current ownership checks, Secrets Manager credentials, unit + PostgreSQL integration + WireMock + AWS staging tests.</textArea></g></svg>
